  "notes": "Small mixer with USB interface. MIC IN is an XLR/6.35 mm combo jack; HEADSET MIC IN and the headphone output are 3.5 mm TRS mini jacks. LINE IN, 2-TRACK IN and MAIN OUT are unbalanced RCA pairs. LINE/USB FROM selects LINE IN or USB playback for the line channel; 2-TRACK TO and LINE/USB TO send those sources to the phones or the main mix. USB type B; powered by an external USB power supply (not listed). Jack labels are partly hidden in the panel drawing and were named after the controls description.",
